{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "fallback_count": 0, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这不是自相矛盾吗？我看就是故意放风试探市场反应。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "从成本角度看，1:1复刻M9的儿童车，如果包含智能交互和高端材质，定价可能确实不低。但15800是否合理，需要等官方公布配置和详细成本才能判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候爸爸给我买的小三轮车，虽然便宜但充满爱。现在孩子想要个玩具车都这么贵，普通家庭怎么承受？希望官方能出个平价版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800的儿童车，这是要让孩子赢在起跑线上吗？不如直接买辆二手QQ，还能全家用。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，简直是在挑战社会公序良俗！给孩子用的东西，应该注重安全和实用，而不是搞奢侈品营销。希望有关部门管管。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "儿童电动车市场其实有不同价位，从几百到几千都有。问界这款如果真卖15800，可能定位高端智能玩具，但性价比如何还得看具体配置。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸。这价格要是真的，估计又是一波韭菜收割。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层和资源分配不均的问题。这不仅仅是商业行为，更可能加剧家长们的焦虑。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障。虽然价格不菲，但一分钱一分货，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "官方声明说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这信息不透明，让人怀疑有炒作嫌疑。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "矛盾激化派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "理性分析，儿童车定价高可能因为包含华为智能技术，但15800确实远超市场同类产品。建议官方公布成本构成，让消费者明明白白。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "看到这个价格，想起自己小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福，但这么贵，普通家庭怎么承受？希望官方能出平价版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，简直是助长攀比之风！家长应该引导孩子正确价值观，而不是用金钱堆砌。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "作为家长，本来想给孩子买辆好点的儿童车，但15800的价格实在让人望而却步。希望官方能推出更亲民的版本。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "科普一下，儿童电动车通常价格在几百到几千元，15800元确实属于超高端。但问界M9本身售价50万起，儿童车复刻其外观，可能定位为收藏品或高端礼品。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "前排围观，这价格够我买好几台switch了，不知道有没有土豪家长买来给孩子玩。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "这价格背后反映的是消费主义陷阱，儿童产品被过度商业化，家长容易陷入焦虑。希望社会能理性看待。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，价格高也正常。支持国货，期待正式发布。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "官方声明含糊其辞，只说后续公布，但销售已经透露价格，这波操作让人看不懂。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "矛盾激化派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "如果真是15800，我宁愿给孩子买辆真的电动车，还能上牌。这儿童车性价比太低。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "fallback_count": 0, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_081", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这不是自相矛盾吗？建议查查是不是饥饿营销。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_082", "text": "从成本角度看，1:1复刻M9的儿童车，如果包含智能交互和高端材质，定价可能确实不低。但15800是否合理，需要官方公布详细配置和成本构成。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_083", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候想要一辆玩具车，爸妈省吃俭用才买得起。现在孩子真幸福，但这么贵，普通家庭只能看看了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_084", "text": "15800？不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！这儿童车是镶金边了吗？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_085", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是在挑战社会公序良俗？给孩子用的东西，应该注重安全和实用，而不是搞奢侈品化。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_086", "text": "问界M9本身定位高端，儿童车复刻其外观，定价高或许有品牌溢价因素。但15800元确实远超普通儿童电动车市场价，建议消费者理性看待。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_087", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层问题。这不仅是商业行为，更可能加剧家长之间的攀比心理，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_088", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障。价格高可能因为技术含量高，支持国货，期待正式发布。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_089", "text": "官方声明含糊其辞，只说后续公布，但销售已经透露价格，这信息不透明，让人怀疑有炒作嫌疑。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "矛盾激化派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_090", "text": "如果真是15800，那这儿童车定位就是高端玩具，面向高收入家庭。普通家庭不必强求，但希望官方能明确产品定位，避免误导。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_091", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实高，但15800的定价远超市场同类产品，除非有独特技术或品牌溢价，否则难以服众。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_092", "text": "作为妈妈，看到这个价格真的心凉，孩子喜欢车，但这么贵我们普通家庭根本买不起，希望官方能考虑推出平价版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_093", "text": "企业定价自由，但儿童产品涉及家庭消费，过高的价格可能引发攀比，不利于社会风气，建议合理定价。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_094", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，技术含量肯定有，但儿童车卖这么贵，是不是有点过度消费品牌了？", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "坐等官方打脸，说好的未定价，销售却先报价，这波操作真是666。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "儿童车市场需要规范，高价不一定代表高品质，家长应理性消费，不要被品牌营销冲昏头脑。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "支持国货，华为和赛力斯的产品质量有保障，价格高一点可以理解，毕竟研发成本高。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "官方声明含糊其辞，到底多少钱？能不能给个准信？这样吊着消费者胃口，太不厚道了。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "如果真是15800，那这价格确实离谱，但官方还没确认，大家先别急着下结论，等正式发布再说。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generati